# Top Weekly Headlines
Friday, 16 October 2026

###
## Anthropic asks users to stop being mean to Claude
 New usage policy cracks down on cruelty to chatbot, alongside slightly
more pressing matters of weapons development, surveillance, and
election interference=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4pHh?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Dtop-article
