desktop footprint.=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4pJ1?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Linux kernel devs drop obligatory confession of AI tool usage
 Torvalds says contributors must understand their code, whatever tools
they use=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4pKT?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## No shame in the Domain Name game: DNS is doomed, literally
