 And you'll trust agents to do that for the same reason you no longer
worry about automatic transmissions=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4pHP?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## New motherboards, old RAM, plenty of life left in yesterday's PCs
